msgstr "くっきりした四角形。ドット絵向け。最も軽い。"

#: views/scaling_filters.h
msgid "Bilinear"
msgstr "Bilinear"

#: views/scaling_filters.h
msgid "Smooth. The usual choice, and light."
msgstr "なめらか。通常の選択で、軽い。"

#: views/scaling_filters.h
msgid "Bicubic"
msgstr "Bicubic"

#: views/scaling_filters.h
msgid "A little sharper than bilinear, for slightly more work."
msgstr "バイリニアより少しシャープで、負荷は少し増える。"

#: views/scaling_filters.h
msgid "Sharp edges, best for 2D games and drawings. Heavier."
msgstr "輪郭がくっきり。2Dゲームやイラストに最適。負荷は高め。"

#: views/scaling_filters.h
msgid "AMD FidelityFX Super Resolution: sharpens a picture drawn smaller than the window, best for 3D games. Moderate work."
msgstr "AMD FidelityFX Super Resolution：ウィンドウより小さく描画された映像をシャープにする。3Dゲームに最適。負荷は中程度。"

